    strides: A list of `ints` that has length `>= 5`.
      1-D tensor of length 5. The stride of the sliding window for each
      dimension of `input`. Must have `strides[0] = strides[4] = 1`.
    padding: A `string` from: `"SAME", "VALID"`.
